{"3466030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Door", "steam_appid": 3466030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3623420, 3625670, 3625680, 3625690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Door&quot; is a dream core style horror decryption survival game that supports up to 4 people to play online. In the suburban scientific research base that is regarded as a mysterious forbidden area by the outside world, a group of scientific researchers open a portal to the unknown world, you will play the role of one of the researchers into this unknown field, your task is to find the lost research data and new clues, and bring back to the research base. There will be dangerous creatures lurking in the dark on the way, you must skillfully avoid its pursuit, with clues to find the way home in this infinite space, you dare to try?<br><br>Leaderboard function</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a global player's clearance time ranking record, will be recorded in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Head shaking]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera shakes when you walk or run, but if you set the value to off, the camera won't shake violently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Mouse speed 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When turning, the camera rotation speed changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Audio size 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the overall volume of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember not to turn it off completely, the gameplay involves audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Anti-aliasing 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can reduce the jagged edges that appear in images presented on a computer screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game is stuck, you can appropriately reduce the setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Resolution 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the game screen resolution.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dark Door&quot; is a dream core style horror decryption survival game that supports up to 4 people to play online. In the suburban scientific research base that is regarded as a mysterious forbidden area by the outside world, a group of scientific researchers open a portal to the unknown world, you will play the role of one of the researchers into this unknown field, your task is to find the lost research data and new clues, and bring back to the research base. There will be dangerous creatures lurking in the dark on the way, you must skillfully avoid its pursuit, with clues to find the way home in this infinite space, you dare to try?<br><br>Leaderboard function</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a global player's clearance time ranking record, will be recorded in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Head shaking]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera shakes when you walk or run, but if you set the value to off, the camera won't shake violently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Mouse speed 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When turning, the camera rotation speed changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Audio size 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the overall volume of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember not to turn it off completely, the gameplay involves audio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Anti-aliasing 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can reduce the jagged edges that appear in images presented on a computer screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game is stuck, you can appropriately reduce the setting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【 Resolution 】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the game screen resolution.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Dark Door&quot; is an online survival horror game for 1-4 players. Players explore an alternate dimension, collect information, avoid monsters and search for the way back home.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466030/1626ca6752ddac70ae26c07d7f96196b654f97ff/header.jpg?t=1747833434", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466030/c28fd8229e04f254c542ba4a946bd481aa535aa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747833434", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466030/c28fd8229e04f254c542ba4a946bd481aa535aa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747833434", "website": null, "pc_req